<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Your Account Has Been Created</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333333;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header-icon {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .header p {
            color: #fef3c7;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #333333;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .message {
            color: #555555;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .account-info {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f9fafb 0%, #f3f4f6 100%);
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }
        .account-info h3 {
            color: #374151;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        .info-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #e5e7eb;
        }
        .info-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .info-label {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .info-value {
            color: #111827;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .role-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .button-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 35px 0;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 16px 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
        }
        .link-fallback {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            word-break: break-all;
        }
        .link-fallback p {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .link-fallback a {
            color: #10b981;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .expiry-notice {
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        }
        .expiry-notice p {
            color: #92400e;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .steps-box {
            background-color: #f0f9ff;
            border: 1px solid #bae6fd;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }
        .steps-box h3 {
            color: #0369a1;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .step {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .step:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        .step-number {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9 0%, #0284c7 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-right: 12px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .step-text {
            color: #0c4a6e;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .security-notice {
            background-color: #fef2f2;
            border: 1px solid #fecaca;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }
        .security-notice p {
            color: #991b1b;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        .footer p {
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #f59e0b;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="header-icon">🎊</div>
            <h1>Your Account Has Been Created!</h1>
            <p>An administrator has created an account for you</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="content">
            <p class="greeting">Hello {{.RecipientName}}! 👋</p>
            
            <p class="message">
                Great news! An administrator has created a <strong>{{.AppName}}</strong> account for you. 
                You're just one step away from accessing the platform.
            </p>

            <!-- Account Information -->
            <div class="account-info">
                <h3>📋 Your Account Details</h3>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Email</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{.RecipientEmail}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Role</span>
                    <span class="role-badge">{{.Role}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="message">
                To activate your account, please verify your email address by clicking the button below:
            </p>

            <div class="button-container">
                <a href="{{.VerifyURL}}" class="button">✓ Verify & Activate Account</a>
            </div>

            <div class="link-fallback">
                <p>If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
                <a href="{{.VerifyURL}}">{{.VerifyURL}}</a>
            </div>

            <div class="expiry-notice">
                <p>⏰ <strong>Important:</strong> This verification link will expire in <strong>{{.ExpiryHours}} hours</strong>.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Next Steps -->
            <div class="steps-box">
                <h3>📝 Next Steps</h3>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">1</div>
                    <div class="step-text">Click the verification button above</div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">2</div>
                    <div class="step-text">Log in with your email and password</div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">3</div>
                    <div class="step-text">Change your password for security</div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">4</div>
                    <div class="step-text">Start exploring {{.AppName}}!</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="security-notice">
                <p>🔒 <strong>Security Tip:</strong> After logging in, we recommend changing your password immediately. 
                Never share your login credentials with anyone.</p>
            </div>

            <p class="message">
                If you have any questions or need assistance, please contact your administrator or our support team.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>© {{.Year}} {{.AppName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>This email was sent to <strong>{{.RecipientEmail}}</strong></p>
            <p style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 11px; color: #d1d5db;">
                If you didn't expect this email, please contact your administrator.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
